,"text":"Alloc failure unwinds charge and restores map; truncation contained by double unmaps and retries; failed split forces unmap except shmem huge; eviction warns on leaks; discard waits for writeback."}],"invariants":[{"sids":["mm/readahead.c::readahead_expand"],"text":"Readahead needs aligned start, stays quantized to minimum order, stops at present entries or failures, extends sizes on trailing growth, latches working-set once."},{"sids":["mm/rmap.c::anon_1","mm/vma.c::reusable_anon_vma","mm/vma.c::anon_vma_compatible","mm/rmap.c::anon_vma_cachep","mm/rmap.c::anon_vma_chain_cachep"],"text":"Reusable anon VMA needs compatible neighbour with single chain; compatibility needs adjacency, policy, file, flags, contiguous offsets; new roots self-parented; two slab caches."},{"sids":["mm/rmap.c::set_tlb_ubc_flush_pending.alt_1","mm/rmap.c::set_tlb_ubc_flush_pending.alt_2","mm/rmap.c::should_defer_flush.alt_1","mm/rmap.c::should_defer_flush.alt_2"],"text":"Pending TLB skips inaccessible entries, else records arch range after clear, counts per space with reset when large, latches writable; deferral needs batching plus arch OK."},{"sids":["mm/rmap.c::invalid_folio_referenced_vma","mm/rmap.c::invalid_mkclean_vma","mm/rmap.c::folio_unmap_pte_batch","mm/rmap.c::ttu_anon_lazyfree_folio","mm/rmap.c::swp_pte_prepare"],"text":"Skip stale or foreign VMAs, cleaning skips private; single-page batch for special entries else one-area groups; anon aborts on swap mismatch; lazy-free clears before sampling; swap keeps exclusivity."},{"sids":["mm/rmap.c::try_to_unmap_one","mm/rmap.c::try_to_migrate_one"],"text":"Locked areas fail unless fully seen without crossing; missing leaf tries huge removal or split-restart; whole coverage ends walk; fault-armed discard suppressed; high-water first."},{"sids":["mm/secretmem.c::SECRETMEM_MODE_MASK","mm/secretmem.c::__ro_after_init","mm/secretmem.c::__secretmem_account_pages","mm/secretmem.c::secretmem_account_folio","mm/secretmem.c::__secretmem_un